unding agencies thank you  very much and I hope to answer some of  your questions online thank you thank  you dr. Palmer for that informative  presentation I would also like to thank  lab roots for making today's educational  webcast possible as a final reminder our  speaker will follow up with any  questions you've submitted via email  that is all for now thank you for  joining us we'll see you next time  goodbye
 

